# Shell scripts must stay LF.
#
# core.autocrlf=true is the norm on Windows, and it would hand a fresh clone
# CRLF copies of the hook scripts in power-bi/04-review/hooks. bash then fails
# on the carriage return with errors like:
#
#   $'\r': command not found
#   syntax error near unexpected token `$'{\r''
#
# which reads as a broken script rather than a line-ending problem. Pin them.
*.sh text eol=lf
